01:33:34.870 --> 01:33:38.820
and still is a great designer, had put together.

01:33:39.040 --> 01:33:44.910
So that was one of the things that really made me want to work at the Rocket eventually.

01:33:45.490 --> 01:33:46.470
Mudhoney sells out.

