01:34:12.830 --> 01:34:18.860
a little tiny amplifier along with it, and we, and that was the, that was kind of the

01:34:18.860 --> 01:34:22.860
genesis for like, this band that we thought about starting, you know.

01:34:24.020 --> 01:34:25.180
It's a Horatio Alger story.

01:34:25.220 --> 01:34:29.980
