01:35:23.700 --> 01:35:24.340
And I agree.

01:35:24.440 --> 01:35:24.880
I agree.

01:35:25.140 --> 01:35:25.760
It's terrible.

01:35:26.060 --> 01:35:26.700
It's terrible.

